msgid "A message will be displayed on the GCS and in the flight log whenever the fuel cell status changes.  The vehicle can only be armed when the fuel cell is reporting a status of 'Running'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:71
#: 30b52724044545b3b3394cd09401ac4a
msgid "Failsafes and Pre-Arm Checks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:73
#: 3df768ba4df84dd0822aa113dd080c00
msgid "Failsafes and pre-arm checks are hard-coded and based on the error codes sent by the fuel cell.  Failsafes have been separated into two groups: Low and Critical.  The error code groups are listed below.  If an error code is received from the fuel cell, the resulting failsafe action will be set by the :ref:`BATTX_FS_LOW_ACT <BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` and :ref:`BATTX_FS_CRT_ACT <BATT_FS_CRT_ACT>` respectively."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:76
#: a981843adaef4fe7a3a4cee9cb4af951
msgid "Monitoring of the fuel cell's internal error codes for pre-arm checks and failsafes are only done on the battery monitor instance allocated for the electrical telemetry.  The electrical battery monitor instance must therefore be set to trigger failsafes based on error codes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:80
#: 4003453e8d82444c96ee1a95cb196079
msgid "Failsafe Low Action Error Code Group"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:152
#: e8a7c14750a24b8b8cf020b9f03261cc
msgid "Failsafe Critical Action Error Code Group"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:259
#: fb31d50648724bc59db35f9c25ede2f9
msgid "Example"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:260
#: b6c7406135334a45b2db70fbc6fb63f7
msgid "This example has been provided to make it clear how the failsafe actions are set."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:262
#: a22c7b3a917a4046af13fbb302e3c9f6
msgid "The battery monitors have been configured so that electrical telemetry data is on battery monitor 1 and hydrogen tank telemetry is on battery monitor 2:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:264
#: bf174768483b4da08814c97e32611f67
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` = 17 (electrical data)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:265
#: 27c9288baded46a88cab019854f75420
msgid ":ref:`BATT2_MONITOR <BATT2_MONITOR>` = 18 (tank data)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:267
#: 392e2c06cd7644779a703ebab7c68a65
msgid "The failsafe actions that correspond to the error code groups listed above are then set on battery monitor 1 as that is the one associated with the electrical telemetry data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:269
#: 86bce81f1b474705a8865ffd46acf31a
msgid ":ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT <BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` = 2 (RTL)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:270
#: dea16dfe03b14c6f9ad5743a1348a595
msgid ":ref:`BATT_FS_CRT_ACT <BATT_FS_CRT_ACT>` = 1 (land)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:272
#: 226e51cd97b54b6f90e7a43e073ae564
msgid "A tank level failsafe has been set on battery monitor 2 so that the vehicle will return to land when the fuel level gets below 25%.  This is done by setting:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:274
#: 0fdc25e257bc4625b03d26228b47faca
msgid ":ref:`BATT2_FS_LOW_ACT <BATT2_FS_LOW_ACT>` = 2 (RTL)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:275
#: 98b88defdabd4a21bc1f7b0a99563327
msgid ":ref:`BATT2_CAPACITY <BATT2_CAPACITY>` = 100"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:276
#: 3170700ac58e419685d596fcfd4558f5
msgid ":ref:`BATTX_LOW_MAH <BATT_LOW_MAH>` = 25"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:278
#: 3985c95093a44278ac0ed0a832214a2f
msgid "As previously mentioned, battery capacity failsafes can be used on this model.  Hence, as a final belt-and-braces approach a critical voltage failsafe has been set on the electrical generator monitor instance to initiate an immediate landing if battery remaining gets to 40%:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:280
#: 5c3c6223d3b24ecc80a916f3f20e3520
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CRT_MAH <BATT_CRT_MAH>` = 40"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie650-fuelcell.rst:281
#: 6647a2b2956241b5a3305cd10959e3a9
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CAPACITY <BATT_CAPACITY>` = 100"
msgstr ""

